1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,119
The simplest tool on any chart is a straight line.

2
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:07,181
In an uptrend, connect one swing low to the next.

3
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:08,700
That's your trend line.

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,717
When price comes back and bounces off it a third time, more traders start to trust it.

5
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:18,273
And when price breaks below it, that's a warning the trend may be ending.

6
00:00:18,621 --> 00:00:21,510
Not a guarantee, but a reason to pay attention.

7
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,725
Trend lines are one of the drawing tools on Meme Street's charts.

8
00:00:26,133 --> 00:00:27,969
Practise at memestreet.net.

